# Treasure XP Leveling Grill Handoff

## Current objective

Continue the grill or start implementation for OSE-style treasure, XP, leveling, and SafeHaven/domain interfaces.

Joel wants the advancement loop to be real OSE-ish play:

- treasure parcels;
- extraction / return to safety;
- campaign-scoped parcel lifecycle;
- campaign-scoped XP ledger;
- settlement/accounting procedure;
- level-up sessions when thresholds are met;
- player-facing skills/artifacts so PlayerAgents understand when to return, settle loot, buy gear, rest, hire, barter, and level;
- full OSE ruleset support to the extent possible;
- interface/domain-first design, not module-specific Worker goo.

